+# Temporal fermion resummation and its actual gauge-matter model
+
+This personal derivation milestone addresses a missing step named in main: the naive spacetime hopping count fails as the time step vanishes. Summing temporal Wilson runs exactly, and retaining the loop's time-closure constraint, gives an author-proposed local physical-curl bound uniform in time resolution and spatial volume for sufficiently heavy supplied fermions. The determinant is then matched to a specified positive Fock boundary amplitude and to an actual dynamical gauge transfer.
+
+- [Uniform temporal resummation and local curl response](notes/BLOCK02_UNIFORM_TEMPORAL_RESUMMATION_AND_CURL_RESPONSE.md) states the heavy-mass condition, open boundaries, physical norms and explicit constants.
+- [Exact open-boundary fermion model](notes/BLOCK03_EXACT_OPEN_BOUNDARY_FERMION_MODEL_MATCH.md) derives the determinant prefactor, time ordering, filled state and energy normalization. Wilson transfer theory and its generic block mechanism have direct prior art, credited there.
+- [Actual coupled gauge transfer and state join](notes/BLOCK04_ACTUAL_GAUGE_MATTER_TRANSFER_AND_STATE_JOIN.md) keeps both endpoint factors and the physical Gauss restriction. Its fixed-volume joint clock/time state limits explicitly depend on provisional PR8162 at frozen commit0f02dc5127416f347e231bbd8aa7c2a8b58a02fa.
+
+Six finite programs use matrix inverses, direct determinants, explicit CAR states, integer chains, separate determinant differences and a sparse coupled Hamiltonian to challenge the formulas. Twenty-three final formula-fault tests reject their declared changes. An earlier orientation mutation survived because it was equivalent under the only contraction order tested; the preserved follow-up exercises all six permitted spatial orders. A first coarse refinement also failed its stated threshold; the target was retained and the slow path refined farther. See [numerical history](review/NUMERICAL_HISTORY.md) for actual outcomes and limitations.
+
+Current status is `conditional-support`: these are author proposals and personal checks, not independent or retained results. [Claim status](CLAIM_STATUS_CERTIFICATE.md), [personal proof review](review/PERSONAL_PROOF_REVIEW.md), [premises and boundaries](review/PREMISES_AND_BOUNDARIES.md), and [source reading](READING_LEDGER.md) delimit the claims. Working notes are preserved as development history and are superseded by the three final notes linked above.
+
+The construction does not establish an infinite-volume interacting phase, gapless charged matter, a fixed finite-payload photon, a native action/time law, an axiom update or a complete TOE. Its sufficient derivative constants are loose. Formal registration, canonical audit evidence, integrated landing checks and independent review remain pending. Editable prompt files: none.
